      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## if_line 通用观测\n\n- 后端只配置一个 OTel 出口: Collector HTTP http://localhost:14318\n- Agent 对话 trace 看 Phoenix: http://localhost:6006\n- 普通后端 trace 看 Grafana Explore -> Tempo\n- 普通后端日志看 Grafana Explore -> VictoriaLogs\n- 如果日志里带有 trace_id，可以从 VictoriaLogs 跳转到 Tempo。\n\n后端建议配置:\n\n```text\nOTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:14318\nOTEL_SERVICE_NAME=if-line-backend\nAGENT_TRACE_SERVICE_NAME=if-line-agent\n```\n\n约定: Collector 根据 service.name 分发；if-line-agent 进 Phoenix，其他 trace 进 Tempo。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
        "pluginVersion": "11.2.0",
      "title": "使用说明",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource",
        "uid": "victorialogs"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
